{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2023-05-03 06:30:00', 'title': 'BIO-TECHNE RELEASES THIRD QUARTER FISCAL 2023 RESULTS', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS , MAY 3, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BIO-TECHNE CORPORATION (NASDAQ: TECH) TODAY REPORTED ITS FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED MARCH 31, 2023. THIRD QUARTER FY2023 HIGHLIGHTS THIRD QUARTER ORGANIC REVENUE INCREASED BY 3% (1% REPORTED) TO $294.1 MILLION AND 4% (2% REPORTED) IN THE FIRST NINE MONTHS OF FISCAL 2023 TO $835.4 MILLION.'}